    1→# Changelog
    3→## 2.4.0
    5→- Added
    6→  - TOML v1.1.0 compatibility
    7→  - Binary wheels for Windows arm64
    9→## 2.3.0
    11→- Added
    12→  - Binary wheels for Python 3.14 (also free-threaded)
    13→- Performance
    14→  - Reduced import time
    16→## 2.2.1
    18→- Fixed
    19→  - Don't attempt to compile binary wheels for Python 3.8, 3.9 and 3.10 where cibuildwheel depends on a conflicting Tomli version
    21→## 2.2.0
    23→- Added
    24→  - mypyc generated binary wheels for common platforms
    26→## 2.1.0
    28→- Deprecated
    29→  - Instantiating `TOMLDecodeError` with free-form arguments.
    30→    `msg`, `doc` and `pos` arguments should be given.
    31→- Added
    32→  - `msg`, `doc`, `pos`, `lineno` and `colno` attributes to `TOMLDecodeError`
    34→## 2.0.2
    36→- Removed
    37→  - Python 3.7 support
    38→- Improved
    39→  - Make `loads` raise `TypeError` not `AttributeError` on bad input types that do not have the `replace` attribute.
    40→    Improve error message when `bytes` is received.
    41→- Type annotations
    42→  - Type annotate `load` input as `typing.IO[bytes]` (previously `typing.BinaryIO`).
    56→## 1.2.3
    58→- Fixed
    59→  - Backport: Allow lower case "t" and "z" in datetimes
    94→## 1.2.0
    96→- Deprecated
    97→  - Text file objects as input to `load`.
    98→    Binary file objects should be used instead to avoid opening a TOML file with universal newlines or with an encoding other than UTF-8.
    100→## 1.1.0
    102→- Added
    103→  - `load` can now take a binary file object
    105→## 1.0.4
    107→- Performance
    108→  - Minor boost (~4%)
    110→## 1.0.3
    112→- Fixed
    113→  - Raise `TOMLDecodeError` instead of `ValueError` when parsing dates and datetimes that pass the regex check but don't correspond to a valid date or datetime.
    114→- Performance
    115→  - Improved multiline literal string parsing performance
    117→## 1.0.2
    119→- Performance
    120→  - Minor boost (~4%)
    122→## 1.0.1
    124→- Performance
    125→  - A significant boost
    127→## 1.0.0
    129→- Fixed
    130→  - Raise `TOMLDecodeError` instead of `KeyError` when overwriting implicitly in an inline table
    147→## 0.2.8
    149→- Performance
    150→  - Significant boost to comment parsing speed
    152→## 0.2.7
    154→- Added
    155→  - Improved `TOMLDecodeError` error messages.
    156→    Line and column are included when applicable.
    158→## 0.2.6
    160→- Performance
    161→  - Over 5% boost
    163→## 0.2.5
    165→- Fixed
    166→  - Made exception type `TOMLDecodeError` when overwriting a value with a deeply nested table
    168→## 0.2.4
    170→- Fixed
    171→  - `TOMLDecodeError` is now raised when attempting to overwrite a value in an inline table's or array's namespace with a table definition
    173→## 0.2.3
    175→- Fixed
    176→  - Error type was not TOMLDecodeError in some obscure cases
    185→## 0.2.1
    187→- Fixed
    188→  - `TOMLDecodeError` is now raised for duplicate keys in inline tables,
    189→    as opposed to silently overriding the previous value
    191→## 0.2.0
    193→- Changed
    194→  - Project name to Tomli
    195→- Performance
    196→  - A performance boost
